# Project instructions

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before starting work and follow it. It is
the single source for this repo's agent instructions (shared with Claude
Code via `CLAUDE.md`), including the logbook protocol:

- At session start: read `docs/agent_log_book.md` ("Current state" + newest entries).
- When the user says "update the log books", or after meaningful work: follow the
  "How to update" paragraph at the top of `docs/agent_log_book.md`,
  `docs/experiment_log_book.md`, `docs/RUNS.md` and `docs/COLLECTIONS.md`, and add
  numbered items to `docs/CHANGES.md` for code changes.

Do not duplicate `AGENTS.md` content here; edit `AGENTS.md` instead.
